{
 "encounter_id": "00730",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I'm Sinead, I care for Mrs Dolan during the week. It's her knees, they're getting so bad she won't go out."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah, it's not that bad. I'm only slow. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mrs Dolan, tell me about the knees."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sore, both of them, especially the right. Stiff when I get up, and they ache at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How far can you walk now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "To the corner shop, and I have to stop twice. It used to be to the church and back, a mile."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been getting worse?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Over the last year, I'd say."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling or redness of the knees, or heat?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no swelling. They crack, though, like a bag of crisps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any falls, or giving way?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I haven't fallen, thank God."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking for the pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day, and naproxen, 250 mg, twice a day, with food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't take the paracetamol four times, I take it when I remember."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She forgets it, doctor. I put it out, but I'm not always there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So it's prescribed four times a day, but you take it as you remember. I won't be cross. What's your history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Osteoarthritis, they said, in my knees and hands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hip replacement on the left, eight years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And who helps you at home?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Her son comes at weekends. I come on weekdays. She lives alone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at the knees, Mrs Dolan.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both knees are a bit enlarged, with crunching when I bend them, and tender along the joint line, more on the right. No heat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it worn out? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That fits wear-and-tear arthritis, osteoarthritis, but I can't rule out something inflammatory because of the night aches, so I'd like to check."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Check how? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange an X-ray of both knees, and a blood test for inflammation."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Can she have injections, doctor? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A steroid injection can help the right knee for a few months, and we can discuss that when the X-ray is back. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. And exercise? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Gentle exercise helps, swimming, cycling, a chair-based class. Walking sticks help too, I'll arrange a physio assessment."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll take her to the class. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
